# The 3D Print group's icons (mitcad#1096): Send to Slicer keeps the
# printer, Edit Printers and Processes… shows the printer with a gear, and
# the two differ in the ribbon, the menus and the command search (they all
# take the command's action's icon); run by ui-print-icons-test.sh.
wait-idle
expect-command-icon make.print3d print-3d make.printers
expect-command-icon make.printers print-settings make.print3d
expect-command-icon inspect.print_analysis print-analysis make.printers
